WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.450
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:14.720 --> 00:16.000
Candied haws!

3
00:16.350 --> 00:19.350
Sweet and crispy candied haws!

4
00:20.030 --> 00:21.190
Candied haws!

5
00:21.230 --> 00:22.830
Sweet and crispy candied haws!

6
00:22.830 --> 00:23.710
Selling cheap!

7
00:23.710 --> 00:26.110
Little girl, do you want some candied haws?

8
00:26.550 --> 00:28.190
Look at you drooling!

9
00:29.600 --> 00:31.230
Give me a stick of candied haws.

10
00:31.230 --> 00:32.070
Okay.

11
00:34.200 --> 00:36.030
Here you go.

12
00:36.250 --> 00:37.490
Take it.

13
00:38.520 --> 00:39.320
Eat up.

14
00:39.560 --> 00:40.560
Is it good?

15
00:41.390 --> 00:42.320
At my place,

16
00:42.320 --> 00:44.520
I have a lot of yummy food and fun toys.

17
00:44.670 --> 00:45.600
Come with me,

18
00:45.640 --> 00:46.900
and they're all yours.

19
00:47.600 --> 00:48.130
Let's go.

20
01:02.590 --> 01:04.709
The good stuff is outside.

21
01:04.730 --> 01:06.450
If anyone asks,

22
01:06.480 --> 01:08.840
just say you're my daughter.

23
01:15.480 --> 01:16.010
Officer,

24
01:16.200 --> 01:17.660
I'm taking my daughter out of the city.

25
01:17.660 --> 01:18.539
Dad!

26
01:22.590 --> 01:24.070
These days, human traffickers

27
01:24.070 --> 01:26.800
don't even care who the child's parents are, huh?

28
01:28.760 --> 01:29.280
Scared?

29
01:30.150 --> 01:32.009
We don't have to do it the hard way.

30
01:32.150 --> 01:33.750
I'm not a fan of blood either.

31
01:34.039 --> 01:34.970
I know the rules.

32
01:35.039 --> 01:36.660
Twenty silver dollars for ransom.

33
01:36.660 --> 01:37.460
I'll pay.

34
01:38.000 --> 01:39.039
It's not just you.

35
01:39.060 --> 01:40.870
The fake beggar behind you

36
01:41.030 --> 01:43.759
and the candied haw seller are your accomplices.

37
01:43.789 --> 01:45.920
I've memorized all your faces.

38
01:46.229 --> 01:48.509
Sixty silver dollars, not a dollar less.

39
01:55.979 --> 01:58.580
Your daughter made 60 silver dollars in total,

40
01:58.970 --> 02:00.430
and you want to take that much?

41
02:00.430 --> 02:01.920
My daughter made 60.

42
02:02.070 --> 02:03.350
I'm taking 20.

43
02:03.690 --> 02:05.520
How's that greedy?

44
02:06.310 --> 02:08.310
There are 40 silver dollars in here.

45
02:09.680 --> 02:12.870
Aren't you lot in the business of scamming?

46
02:13.000 --> 02:14.590
You must be terrified of getting caught.

47
02:14.590 --> 02:16.910
Consider this symbolic hush money

48
02:17.840 --> 02:19.590
to give you peace of mind.

49
02:22.710 --> 02:23.800
You're right.

50
02:24.079 --> 02:25.410
To give us peace of mind.

51
02:26.400 --> 02:28.310
Peace of mind is indeed very important.

52
02:28.310 --> 02:30.030
Take Jiang Feiyan for example.

53
02:30.030 --> 02:31.470
She knows we're scammers,

54
02:31.470 --> 02:34.150
so she must join Tianxiang Sect and follow the rules.

55
02:34.150 --> 02:36.079
That way, we'll have peace of mind.

56
02:37.870 --> 02:39.870
That's what I'm talking about, kid.

57
02:40.910 --> 02:41.910
You're sensible.

58
02:46.750 --> 02:48.150
I have one more question.

59
02:49.590 --> 02:51.250
You also know we're scammers,

60
02:51.360 --> 02:53.760
but I don't want you to join Tianxiang Sect.

61
02:54.310 --> 02:55.710
What should we do then?

62
02:58.110 --> 02:59.829
I've already taken the money.

63
03:00.000 --> 03:01.310
Trust that my lips are sealed.

64
03:01.310 --> 03:03.310
If my child makes money again,

65
03:03.640 --> 03:05.010
I'll just ask you for it.

66
03:07.430 --> 03:08.630
I'll get going.

67
05:20.400 --> 05:24.320
[A Prophet]

68
05:24.840 --> 05:27.400
[Episode 18]

69
05:30.870 --> 05:31.770
[Press Area]

70
05:33.240 --> 05:34.760
["Alluring Phantom" Movie Press Conference]

71
05:40.020 --> 05:42.720
[Alluring Phantom]

72
05:42.820 --> 05:44.140
[Yunhe Temple]

73
05:43.720 --> 05:44.310
Please.

74
05:46.920 --> 05:47.480
Master.

75
05:48.070 --> 05:48.600
How is it?

76
05:48.950 --> 05:50.550
I think I did a pretty good job

77
05:50.659 --> 05:52.659
redecorating your esteemed place.

78
05:52.800 --> 05:54.159
I didn't cut any corners.

79
05:54.159 --> 05:56.360
It cost me a pretty penny.

80
05:56.870 --> 05:57.950
But I have to say,

81
05:58.190 --> 05:59.750
this idea of yours is

82
06:00.240 --> 06:01.160
brilliant.

83
06:03.750 --> 06:04.600
Silence!

84
06:11.600 --> 06:12.270
Listen.

85
06:17.390 --> 06:18.310
Mr. Tang,

86
06:18.680 --> 06:20.040
you really went all out.

87
06:20.790 --> 06:22.030
You know your stuff.

88
06:22.190 --> 06:23.630
I hired the most expensive

89
06:23.630 --> 06:26.040
and professional music team in the industry.

90
06:26.040 --> 06:27.270
They'll hide in that room.

91
06:27.270 --> 06:28.250
With my signal,

92
06:28.280 --> 06:29.150
they'll play whatever

93
06:29.150 --> 06:30.410
sound effect you need.

94
06:45.890 --> 06:46.800
What about the atmosphere?

95
06:46.800 --> 06:47.730
The atmosphere!

96
06:49.630 --> 06:50.720
Spread it evenly.

97
06:55.270 --> 06:56.480
Enough. Leave.

98
06:59.070 --> 07:00.000
Yang Xiaozhong,

99
07:00.160 --> 07:01.960
is it just me,

100
07:02.510 --> 07:04.160
or is the visual a bit flat?

101
07:05.040 --> 07:07.800
For Miss Manyu's entrance, do you think she should

102
07:07.800 --> 07:09.190
fly down from the sky

103
07:09.280 --> 07:10.960
or pop out from the ground?

104
07:11.560 --> 07:14.270
Can't she just walk out of the crowd?

105
07:14.360 --> 07:15.120
No, no, no.

106
07:15.240 --> 07:15.920
Master.

107
07:16.190 --> 07:16.920
The visuals.

108
07:16.950 --> 07:18.070
It must be

109
07:18.070 --> 07:19.390
a visual spectacle that

110
07:19.390 --> 07:20.870
stays with the audience forever.

111
07:20.870 --> 07:22.160
Art Director, come here.

112
07:22.160 --> 07:22.920
Take note of this.

113
07:22.920 --> 07:24.000
Get the lighting team

114
07:24.000 --> 07:26.510
to make a lightning bolt.

115
07:26.510 --> 07:28.120
With a crack of thunder,

116
07:28.120 --> 07:28.920
Miss Manyu will be

117
07:28.920 --> 07:30.430
blasted out from the ground.

118
07:30.430 --> 07:32.050
That will be explosive enough.

119
07:32.050 --> 07:33.130
Everyone's eyes

120
07:33.159 --> 07:35.570
will be fixed on Manyu and only Manyu.

121
07:35.590 --> 07:36.740
An event that will

122
07:36.770 --> 07:39.300
drain every journalist's camera battery.

123
07:39.510 --> 07:41.830
Since we want this to be believable,

124
07:42.040 --> 07:43.680
wouldn't it make more sense

125
07:43.800 --> 07:46.130
for the spirit to possess a normal person?

126
07:47.870 --> 07:48.870
Did you hear that?

127
07:49.000 --> 07:49.870
That's professionalism.

128
07:49.870 --> 07:51.750
Your suggestion is excellent.

129
07:51.750 --> 07:54.600
But I have a small request.

130
07:54.600 --> 07:56.750
Before Miss Manyu is possessed,

131
07:56.770 --> 08:00.330
I'll invite you to make a grand entrance.

132
08:00.480 --> 08:03.480
You'll go on stage to perform a grand ritual.

133
08:03.600 --> 08:05.750
I'll have Sound and Lighting fully cooperate with you.

134
08:05.750 --> 08:08.160
On the surface, it's to pray for this movie's success.

135
08:08.160 --> 08:09.070
But

136
08:09.070 --> 08:10.950
during the prayer,

137
08:11.600 --> 08:13.000
the ghost will return

138
08:13.190 --> 08:15.000
and possess Miss Manyu.

139
08:15.120 --> 08:17.070
The eerie vibes will be off the charts.

140
08:17.070 --> 08:19.270
I need a dramatic moment to play out then.

141
08:19.270 --> 08:22.590
I want time to freeze at that moment.

142
08:22.800 --> 08:24.480
I want that moment to be

143
08:24.480 --> 08:26.280
imprinted in everyone's minds.

144
08:29.920 --> 08:32.380
Why not have He Manzhi strangle you to death?

145
08:33.600 --> 08:34.630
Can she do it?

146
08:34.870 --> 08:35.720
Well...

147
08:35.720 --> 08:36.380
Of course,

148
08:37.049 --> 08:39.970
the strangulation pressure must be regulated.

149
08:40.200 --> 08:41.120
She can't just keep

150
08:41.120 --> 08:42.870
strangling me, or I could die.

151
08:42.890 --> 08:44.090
This strangulation

152
08:44.360 --> 08:45.670
is just a means,

153
08:45.790 --> 08:46.600
not an end.

154
08:46.620 --> 08:47.740
What's the end?

155
08:47.910 --> 08:50.550
It's to make everyone who sees me being strangled

156
08:50.550 --> 08:51.960
feel a kind of...

157
08:53.960 --> 08:54.790
Sadness.

158
08:55.390 --> 08:56.440
Heartache.

159
08:57.000 --> 08:57.720
Anxiety.

160
08:57.740 --> 08:59.400
No one will be anxious for you.

161
08:59.870 --> 09:01.030
It's not up to me to decide

162
09:01.030 --> 09:02.190
if she'll strangle you.

163
09:02.190 --> 09:05.000
We'll have to see what Ms. He does then.

164
09:05.480 --> 09:07.810
She probably won't have the heart to do it.

165
09:14.940 --> 09:16.060
Mr. Tang.

166
09:17.400 --> 09:19.970
Look at what's written in this contract.

167
09:20.550 --> 09:22.690
The company wants me to act in a designated script

168
09:22.690 --> 09:23.720
but won't let me interfere

169
09:23.720 --> 09:25.850
with the plot and character settings.

170
09:26.600 --> 09:27.790
You guys want me

171
09:27.790 --> 09:29.670
to be a puppet on a string,

172
09:29.760 --> 09:31.610
but you don't respect me at all.

173
09:31.630 --> 09:32.380
Seriously.

174
09:36.550 --> 09:37.910
What are you still doing here?

175
09:37.910 --> 09:39.690
Didn't you say there's still an outstanding payment?

176
09:39.690 --> 09:40.640
Go settle it now!

177
09:40.670 --> 09:41.840
How about this?

178
09:41.860 --> 09:42.980
You cover it first.

179
09:43.480 --> 09:44.360
Tang,

180
09:44.360 --> 09:46.480
when you said to go all in that day,

181
09:46.720 --> 09:47.670
it really pumped me up—

182
09:47.670 --> 09:48.870
Keep your voice down.

183
09:50.000 --> 09:52.200
I've transferred all of my net worth to you.

184
09:52.200 --> 09:53.390
What else do I have to cover it with?

185
09:53.390 --> 09:54.360
That's not my problem.

186
09:54.360 --> 09:55.390
Listen.

187
09:55.440 --> 09:56.500
If you mess this up,

188
09:56.670 --> 09:59.000
don't blame me for getting harsh with you.

189
09:59.360 --> 10:00.390
I'm done talking to you.

190
10:00.390 --> 10:01.920
I have to go find the master.

191
10:03.240 --> 10:04.440
Go settle it now.

192
10:04.600 --> 10:06.600
Don't just stand here like an idiot.

193
10:17.790 --> 10:18.840
Was the movie good?

194
10:18.840 --> 10:20.390
Yes!

195
10:24.360 --> 10:25.630
Actually,

196
10:25.650 --> 10:27.450
what you saw today

197
10:28.290 --> 10:30.290
can only be deemed half a movie.

198
10:30.320 --> 10:32.430
That this trouble-ridden half

199
10:32.550 --> 10:34.390
is able to meet today's audience

200
10:34.480 --> 10:36.320
is entirely due to the protection

201
10:36.320 --> 10:38.050
and stewardship of one person.

202
10:38.320 --> 10:39.320
Let us

203
10:39.960 --> 10:41.000
welcome him!

204
10:43.360 --> 10:44.600
Who?

205
10:44.600 --> 10:46.080
I don't see anyone.

206
10:46.080 --> 10:46.870
There's no one.

207
10:46.870 --> 10:48.480
Tang Yushan.

208
10:50.840 --> 10:52.030
What's that sound?

209
10:52.360 --> 10:53.440
It's so creepy.

210
10:59.460 --> 11:00.700
Technical issue!

211
11:04.120 --> 11:05.440
What are you doing?

212
11:05.440 --> 11:06.480
What's with this sound effect?

213
11:06.480 --> 11:07.550
Did I tell you to play it?

214
11:07.550 --> 11:09.320
Didn't I tell you to wait for my signal?

215
11:09.320 --> 11:10.630
It's not us.

216
11:10.840 --> 11:12.300
We didn't touch anything!

217
11:14.910 --> 11:15.960
Look and listen.

218
11:15.960 --> 11:16.870
Listen for yourself!

219
11:16.870 --> 11:18.260
Look and listen for yourself.

220
11:18.260 --> 11:20.380
I thought you found another team.

221
11:20.410 --> 11:21.670
Did you see the master?

222
11:21.830 --> 11:22.990
No, I didn't.

223
11:26.870 --> 11:27.750
Master!

224
11:28.600 --> 11:29.360
Master!

225
11:36.620 --> 11:37.880
What's wrong, Master?

226
11:38.080 --> 11:39.280
What happened to you?

227
11:39.390 --> 11:40.390
That female ghost

228
11:40.850 --> 11:42.140
is too hostile.

229
11:42.450 --> 11:43.330
I...

230
11:44.240 --> 11:46.000
I can't suppress her anymore.

231
11:46.320 --> 11:47.580
You must suppress her!

232
11:48.000 --> 11:49.790
I've built up all this atmosphere...

233
11:49.790 --> 11:51.000
I doubled the pay!

234
11:51.030 --> 11:53.160
How can you say you can't suppress her?

235
11:53.510 --> 11:54.840
What's with the coffin?

236
11:57.960 --> 11:58.870
Master, hold on.

237
11:58.870 --> 11:59.720
Hang in there!

238
12:17.360 --> 12:18.360
It's moving!

239
12:52.270 --> 12:53.470
What the heck is that?

240
12:53.670 --> 12:54.400
What is that?

241
12:54.510 --> 12:55.240
I don't know.

242
13:09.270 --> 13:10.310
Don't panic, everyone!

243
13:10.310 --> 13:11.240
Don't be afraid.

244
13:11.360 --> 13:12.320
This is

245
13:12.510 --> 13:13.870
a little surprise

246
13:13.960 --> 13:16.510
I arranged for you.

247
13:16.750 --> 13:17.320
Come on.

248
13:17.550 --> 13:18.720
Come closer.

249
13:18.720 --> 13:19.480
Nothing to be afraid of!

250
13:19.480 --> 13:21.030
Come.

251
13:22.720 --> 13:23.630
Come closer.

252
13:23.750 --> 13:25.910
Get the full experience.

253
13:31.240 --> 13:32.750
What is all this mess?

254
13:32.770 --> 13:34.060
Why is there a coffin?

255
13:34.550 --> 13:36.010
Your costume is wrong too.

256
13:36.230 --> 13:37.250
Where's the necklace?

257
13:37.250 --> 13:38.710
Why aren't you wearing it?

258
13:38.750 --> 13:39.670
Go put it on.

259
13:41.360 --> 13:44.120
The movie you just saw on screen

260
13:44.390 --> 13:47.550
is "Alluring Phantom," the posthumous work

261
13:48.030 --> 13:49.490
of my late wife, He Manzhi.

262
13:49.550 --> 13:52.080
Unfortunately, halfway through filming,

263
13:52.360 --> 13:53.720
Manzhi passed away.

264
13:54.150 --> 13:56.320
In order to see Manzhi again,

265
13:56.510 --> 13:58.080
I went out of my way to find

266
13:58.080 --> 13:59.540
a master from Yunhe Temple

267
13:59.600 --> 14:01.000
to help me

268
14:01.000 --> 14:02.600
summon back He Manzhi's soul

269
14:02.600 --> 14:04.510
and have it take over

270
14:04.510 --> 14:06.240
the carefully selected

271
14:06.440 --> 14:08.200
Miss Jiang Manyu's body.

272
14:08.390 --> 14:10.790
This is to ensure that this movie shoot

273
14:10.810 --> 14:12.600
can be completed smoothly,

274
14:12.630 --> 14:14.470
so I can make up for my regrets.

275
14:14.700 --> 14:15.900
Thank you all.

276
14:17.240 --> 14:18.500
Why are you still here?

277
14:18.600 --> 14:19.750
Go put on the necklace

278
14:19.750 --> 14:20.240
now.

279
14:23.540 --> 14:25.820
Do you like that necklace?

280
14:26.030 --> 14:27.200
Manyu, listen up.

281
14:27.360 --> 14:29.050
This is not the time to joke around.

282
14:29.050 --> 14:30.150
I can replace you in a heartbeat.

283
14:30.150 --> 14:30.790
Go now.

284
14:33.040 --> 14:34.320
Manyu...

285
14:36.240 --> 14:37.600
Do I...

286
14:39.520 --> 14:41.760
look like Jiang Manyu?

287
14:44.550 --> 14:45.320
Let go.

288
14:46.000 --> 14:46.960
Let go of me!

289
14:48.240 --> 14:49.120
What?

290
14:50.960 --> 14:52.000
Do you...

291
14:53.890 --> 14:56.040
not like holding my hand anymore?

292
14:58.200 --> 14:58.960
Man...

293
15:01.440 --> 15:02.550
Manzhi.

294
15:03.670 --> 15:05.670
How'd you come back without wearing

295
15:05.920 --> 15:07.010
the necklace?

296
15:09.960 --> 15:10.670
Let go...

297
15:13.480 --> 15:14.240
Let go.

298
15:18.530 --> 15:21.760
♪ It tightens more; even broken, our bond endures ♪

299
15:22.900 --> 15:25.720
♪ We love each other like crazy ♪

300
15:26.230 --> 15:28.980
♪ We're a pair in this life ♪

301
15:29.300 --> 15:31.800
♪ Lying in one bed; sharing one coffin when dead ♪

302
15:31.870 --> 15:36.720
♪ Even if we turn to ashes, we still belong together ♪

303
15:35.550 --> 15:37.630
Master, save me!

304
15:37.630 --> 15:39.150
Tang Yushan.

305
15:38.510 --> 15:40.730
♪ Don't look back or panic ♪

306
15:39.480 --> 15:42.750
You think a mere sorcerer can save your life?

307
15:41.620 --> 15:43.980
♪ I'm right here, by your side ♪

308
15:43.120 --> 15:44.320
Listen up.

309
15:44.430 --> 15:46.640
♪ Lean against your back and breathe your scent ♪

310
15:44.480 --> 15:46.360
Ever since the day

311
15:46.360 --> 15:48.270
I possessed Ms. Manyu,

312
15:47.250 --> 15:51.630
♪ With cold long nails, I loosen your robe ♪

313
15:48.550 --> 15:50.870
I've been in her body.

314
15:51.240 --> 15:53.200
I've never left.

315
15:52.830 --> 15:55.490
♪ We love each other like crazy ♪

316
15:53.870 --> 15:55.930
This is the day I've been waiting for.

317
15:56.350 --> 15:58.720
♪ Through every life, we remain a pair ♪

318
15:57.910 --> 15:58.910
Tang Yushan!

319
15:58.910 --> 16:01.000
Even when I'm dead,

320
15:59.460 --> 16:01.980
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

321
16:01.320 --> 16:03.270
you still want to exploit me!

322
16:03.840 --> 16:04.790
Exploit her?

323
16:04.790 --> 16:05.480
Yeah.

324
16:05.480 --> 16:07.080
How did Mr. Tang exploit her?

325
16:09.550 --> 16:10.870
Thank the heavens.

326
16:11.000 --> 16:13.120
Miss Manzhi has returned!

327
16:13.510 --> 16:14.480
-What? -Manzhi?

328
16:15.480 --> 16:16.480
Didn't you say...

329
16:17.010 --> 16:20.200
Didn't you say you've been missing me

330
16:20.670 --> 16:22.320
and dying to see me?

331
16:22.470 --> 16:24.520
Now that I'm back,

332
16:24.960 --> 16:27.960
why don't you seem happy at all?

333
16:27.960 --> 16:29.550
I...

334
16:29.550 --> 16:30.630
I'm happy—

335
16:30.890 --> 16:33.300
♪ I'm right here, by your side ♪

336
16:33.440 --> 16:34.240
Tang Yushan.

337
16:33.690 --> 16:36.300
♪ Lean against your back and breathe your scent ♪

338
16:34.790 --> 16:35.670
Give me a smile.

339
16:36.120 --> 16:37.390
I like seeing you smile.

340
16:37.000 --> 16:41.300
♪ With cold long nails, I loosen your robe ♪

341
16:37.510 --> 16:38.490
Smile.

342
16:38.500 --> 16:39.750
Smile!

343
16:41.360 --> 16:42.750
Didn't you say you'd love me forever?

344
16:42.520 --> 16:45.290
♪ We love each other like crazy ♪

345
16:42.910 --> 16:43.720
Say you love me.

346
16:43.720 --> 16:44.550
Say you love me!

347
16:44.550 --> 16:45.030
Say it!

348
16:45.550 --> 16:46.720
Say you love me!

349
16:45.850 --> 16:48.290
♪ Through every life, we remain a pair ♪

350
16:46.870 --> 16:47.630
I love you.

351
16:48.200 --> 16:48.870
I love you.

352
16:49.600 --> 16:51.110
I love you!

353
16:51.150 --> 16:52.720
-I love you! -Mr. Tang's face is all swollen.

354
16:52.720 --> 16:54.510
I love you!

355
16:55.550 --> 16:57.240
Since you love me,

356
16:58.840 --> 17:01.080
why did you kill me?

357
17:03.030 --> 17:05.109
Why did you kill me!

358
17:05.310 --> 17:06.369
I loved you so much!

359
17:06.400 --> 17:07.160
What?

360
17:07.160 --> 17:08.589
Mr. Tang killed He Manzhi?

361
17:08.589 --> 17:09.680
What's going on?

362
17:09.680 --> 17:10.790
Why did you kill me?

363
17:10.829 --> 17:11.480
Manzhi!

364
17:11.720 --> 17:12.790
Manzhi!

365
17:26.130 --> 17:27.089
Yes.

366
17:28.000 --> 17:29.200
I admit

367
17:29.690 --> 17:32.010
I killed you with my own hands.

368
17:33.110 --> 17:35.070
I shouldn't have yielded to you

369
17:35.350 --> 17:37.110
and let you shoot those scenes

370
17:37.130 --> 17:39.500
that drained you.

371
17:41.790 --> 17:44.240
To protect your reputation,

372
17:44.480 --> 17:45.680
I hid the fact

373
17:46.110 --> 17:48.750
that you had severe depression.

374
17:48.750 --> 17:50.270
I delayed your treatment.

375
17:50.320 --> 17:51.640
I let you down!

376
17:52.330 --> 17:53.570
I'm a monster!

377
17:54.140 --> 17:55.790
I, Tang Yushan, let you down!

378
17:56.160 --> 17:58.000
I, Tang Yushan, am a monster!

379
17:58.440 --> 18:02.750
"A Ghost-Possessed Actress Graces the Silver Screen:

380
18:02.840 --> 18:06.470
Mr. Tang Passionately Plays Out

381
18:06.640 --> 18:08.880
an Unresolved Sorrow."

382
18:08.910 --> 18:11.500
Since you believe I killed you,

383
18:11.960 --> 18:12.640
come on.

384
18:14.160 --> 18:15.070
Kill me so I can

385
18:15.550 --> 18:17.350
accompany you in the afterlife!

386
18:17.400 --> 18:18.440
Kill me—

387
18:20.910 --> 18:22.830
You think I don't dare?

388
18:24.610 --> 18:26.850
Manzhi.

389
18:27.550 --> 18:28.790
Manzhi...

390
18:38.270 --> 18:40.140
Fiend, cease your insolence!

391
19:27.310 --> 19:28.420
I hereby announce

392
19:29.440 --> 19:33.290
that the world's first movie starring a ghost

393
19:34.640 --> 19:36.240
starts shooting tomorrow.

394
19:37.000 --> 19:39.160
He Manzhi!

395
19:40.110 --> 19:41.480
Did you see that?

396
20:05.000 --> 20:05.880
Soul, enter!

397
20:19.750 --> 20:20.640
Manyu?

398
20:25.960 --> 20:26.790
Manzhi?

399
20:30.310 --> 20:31.270
This won't do!

400
20:31.310 --> 20:32.200
She's unconscious.

401
20:32.200 --> 20:34.000
She still has to act in the movie!

402
20:35.070 --> 20:37.200
I went out of the city and up the mountain to find my master.

403
20:37.200 --> 20:39.270
My master went down the mountain and into the city to find his master.

404
20:39.270 --> 20:41.550
My master's master went out of the city and across the river,

405
20:41.550 --> 20:42.830
dug up his master's grave,

406
20:42.830 --> 20:44.000
and found this gourd.

407
20:44.000 --> 20:45.200
I finally subdued it,

408
20:45.200 --> 20:45.800
but you...

409
20:46.440 --> 20:47.640
I'm just...

410
20:47.640 --> 20:48.030
I...

411
20:48.240 --> 20:48.640
I...

412
20:48.640 --> 20:49.960
I need this

413
20:49.960 --> 20:50.920
and this to...

414
20:52.830 --> 20:54.590
Figure something out for me!

415
20:56.720 --> 20:57.440
Master.

416
20:57.920 --> 20:59.200
You must

417
20:59.350 --> 21:00.830
have another solution.

418
21:01.440 --> 21:02.570
I'm counting on you.

419
21:03.400 --> 21:04.960
There is a solution.

420
21:05.200 --> 21:06.600
I need to place this gourd

421
21:06.790 --> 21:08.160
as an offering at a temple.

422
21:08.160 --> 21:10.350
And I have to negotiate with He Manzhi's spirit.

423
21:10.350 --> 21:11.310
However,

424
21:11.310 --> 21:12.960
my Yunhe Temple is too small.

425
21:13.680 --> 21:16.680
You must finance the reconstruction of a new temple.

426
21:16.710 --> 21:18.560
No problem. Name your price.

427
21:21.160 --> 21:22.000
How much?

428
21:24.270 --> 21:25.110
Master,

429
21:25.160 --> 21:28.570
all my money is in the movie project.

430
21:29.400 --> 21:31.270
I can't afford that much.

431
21:35.270 --> 21:36.030
Manyu.

432
21:37.480 --> 21:38.390
You're awake!

433
21:41.910 --> 21:42.590
Wait...

434
21:43.090 --> 21:44.160
Where am I?

435
21:44.830 --> 21:45.590
Mr. Tang.

436
21:45.640 --> 21:47.170
Aren't we shooting a movie?

437
21:47.440 --> 21:48.640
Why am I tied up?

438
21:48.640 --> 21:49.770
I'll explain later.

439
21:50.260 --> 21:51.390
Let's do as you said.

440
21:51.400 --> 21:52.460
As for the money...

441
21:54.480 --> 21:55.540
I'll figure it out.

442
21:55.910 --> 21:59.390
[Changfeng Pictures]

443
21:56.710 --> 21:57.540
Mr. Tang.

444
21:57.790 --> 21:59.650
He owns half of the lending market

445
21:59.710 --> 22:00.790
in Yucheng,

446
22:01.000 --> 22:02.110
and I own half.

447
22:03.230 --> 22:06.080
You came to the right people.

448
22:12.200 --> 22:13.110
Mr. Tang,

449
22:13.240 --> 22:14.640
you called us here

450
22:14.790 --> 22:16.910
just to mortgage a car and a house?

451
22:16.930 --> 22:19.500
I'm afraid that's not enough collateral.

452
22:22.550 --> 22:23.680
You own half,

453
22:24.270 --> 22:25.400
and you own half?

454
22:25.830 --> 22:27.030
That's great.

455
22:27.270 --> 22:28.350
Then I believe

456
22:28.750 --> 22:30.030
no news in Yucheng

457
22:30.050 --> 22:32.050
gets past the two of you.

458
22:33.400 --> 22:35.200
You must read the papers, right?

459
22:35.440 --> 22:36.920
Everyone is talking about

460
22:36.940 --> 22:39.420
the movie "Alluring Phantom" now.

461
22:39.680 --> 22:41.640
All the money I'm borrowing from you two

462
22:41.640 --> 22:44.160
will be used to shoot this movie.

463
22:49.960 --> 22:51.120
Still not convinced?

464
22:51.120 --> 22:51.940
Then forget it.

465
22:51.940 --> 22:53.940
I never force anyone into anything.

466
22:54.640 --> 22:55.640
Mr. Tang,

467
22:55.890 --> 22:58.330
it seems you have everything ready,

468
22:58.750 --> 23:00.610
and all you need is a crucial push.

469
23:00.790 --> 23:01.640
Then...

470
23:04.400 --> 23:05.750
Let us be

471
23:07.560 --> 23:09.030
that crucial push.

472
23:11.240 --> 23:13.070
Congratulations, Mr. Tang.

473
23:13.090 --> 23:13.850
No need.

474
23:16.880 --> 23:19.070
I should congratulate you instead.

475
23:28.270 --> 23:30.360
Cast your eyes afar

476
23:31.110 --> 23:33.400
to encompass the world.

477
23:46.160 --> 23:47.030
All in.

478
23:48.960 --> 23:50.200
Decide already.

479
23:50.400 --> 23:51.600
My cards aren't good.

480
23:51.960 --> 23:52.920
I need to pee.

481
23:53.480 --> 23:54.240
Hurry up.

482
23:54.640 --> 23:55.400
I fold.

483
23:57.340 --> 23:57.890
And you?

484
23:58.960 --> 23:59.880
Call.

485
24:00.310 --> 24:01.110
Don't fold.

486
24:01.110 --> 24:01.960
I can't.

487
24:05.440 --> 24:06.640
What did I say?

488
24:06.750 --> 24:08.240
I said my cards were bad.

489
24:08.510 --> 24:09.590
I let you call,

490
24:09.830 --> 24:11.160
but you didn't dare.

491
24:11.350 --> 24:12.440
Letting me win, huh?

492
24:12.440 --> 24:13.440
Sorry about this.

493
24:13.510 --> 24:14.590
Thank you, bosses.

494
24:16.510 --> 24:17.350
Tang.

495
24:18.640 --> 24:20.070
We've already

496
24:20.200 --> 24:22.310
thrown a lot of cash your way.

497
24:22.550 --> 24:25.110
Could we invest a bit more

498
24:25.480 --> 24:27.350
in this project of yours?

499
24:30.390 --> 24:32.100
When I asked you to invest,

500
24:32.790 --> 24:34.220
you all refused.

501
24:34.590 --> 24:36.120
It's just like these cards.

502
24:36.330 --> 24:37.960
Isn't it against the rules

503
24:37.990 --> 24:39.990
to take back the cards

504
24:40.350 --> 24:41.480
you've discarded?

505
24:41.480 --> 24:42.680
It's inappropriate.

506
24:42.960 --> 24:43.550
Next time.

507
24:43.550 --> 24:45.550
Let's work something out next time.

508
24:46.000 --> 24:47.590
Is this all I am to you?

509
24:47.880 --> 24:49.240
Didn't I invest in

510
24:49.440 --> 24:50.310
your last movie?

511
24:50.310 --> 24:50.590
Yes.

512
24:50.880 --> 24:52.680
Even though I lost everything,

513
24:52.750 --> 24:53.750
look at me now:

514
24:53.840 --> 24:55.710
aren't I still by your side?

515
24:58.960 --> 25:01.030
We're talking about business now.

516
25:01.720 --> 25:03.200
Why bring up loyalty?

517
25:03.950 --> 25:05.120
I'm not a fool.

518
25:08.110 --> 25:08.720
Tang,

519
25:09.110 --> 25:10.000
no matter what,

520
25:10.070 --> 25:11.720
you're still a junior.

521
25:12.070 --> 25:14.160
We came to you with sincerity.

522
25:14.820 --> 25:16.380
You should watch your tone.

523
25:27.470 --> 25:28.470
I need to pee.

524
25:31.160 --> 25:31.960
Let's keep things amicable.

525
25:31.960 --> 25:33.510
Tang, we're all buddies.

526
25:33.960 --> 25:36.780
Have a drink and let it pass.

527
25:36.810 --> 25:37.930
Let it pass.

528
25:38.640 --> 25:39.480
Tang,

529
25:39.680 --> 25:41.680
we're all in the same circle.

530
25:41.880 --> 25:44.110
Let's put everything on the table.

531
25:44.270 --> 25:44.960
Right?

532
25:45.830 --> 25:47.190
Don't be angry.

533
25:47.210 --> 25:48.870
Come on, let's drink with him.

534
25:48.920 --> 25:49.550
Buddy,

535
25:49.590 --> 25:50.920
let me toast you, okay?

536
25:50.920 --> 25:51.590
Come on.

537
25:51.590 --> 25:52.750
Let's toast

538
25:52.750 --> 25:53.880
Tang together.

539
25:54.440 --> 25:55.200
Come on, Tang.

540
25:55.200 --> 25:55.880
Come on.

541
25:56.350 --> 25:57.480
I see.

542
25:58.200 --> 25:58.830
You all

543
25:59.270 --> 26:00.110
want a chance,

544
26:00.400 --> 26:00.960
right?

545
26:01.480 --> 26:02.030
Okay.

546
26:03.720 --> 26:05.180
I'll give you this chance!

547
26:05.190 --> 26:06.840
Go all in with me.

548
26:10.970 --> 26:11.820
Are you game?

549
26:26.310 --> 26:27.440
Stop following me.

550
26:28.640 --> 26:29.200
Manyu.

551
26:33.070 --> 26:33.800
How about it?

552
26:34.830 --> 26:36.390
If you ask me, Mr. Tang,

553
26:36.750 --> 26:38.310
you should stop following me, okay?

554
26:38.310 --> 26:40.110
The ghost possesses me, not you.

555
26:40.440 --> 26:41.750
Of course you're not afraid.

556
26:41.750 --> 26:43.610
Anyway, I can't act in your movie.

557
26:43.720 --> 26:44.510
Manyu,

558
26:44.830 --> 26:46.110
I offered you

559
26:46.130 --> 26:47.760
the same pay as Manzhi.

560
26:48.030 --> 26:49.200
It's the highest.

561
26:49.960 --> 26:51.110
Still not satisfied?

562
26:51.110 --> 26:52.510
Acting in your movie,

563
26:52.590 --> 26:55.110
I represent both He Manzhi and myself.

564
26:55.880 --> 26:57.680
Shouldn't you pay me double?

565
27:00.750 --> 27:01.480
Right!

566
27:02.510 --> 27:04.160
You're right. Double it is!

567
27:05.070 --> 27:06.140
You're worth it.

568
27:09.060 --> 27:11.060
Am I short of money?

569
27:11.440 --> 27:13.200
My dad is a bank president.

570
27:13.680 --> 27:14.680
Get it straight.

571
27:14.850 --> 27:16.240
So...

572
27:17.960 --> 27:18.680
Manyu,

573
27:18.790 --> 27:19.680
isn't all this

574
27:19.680 --> 27:21.920
money talk getting a bit

575
27:22.200 --> 27:23.480
too tedious?

576
27:23.750 --> 27:24.790
What is money?

577
27:24.910 --> 27:27.310
It's the most worthless thing in the world.

578
27:27.590 --> 27:28.790
I think a person

579
27:29.440 --> 27:30.350
should never

580
27:30.350 --> 27:31.950
lose sight of what they want.

581
27:32.270 --> 27:34.550
What you really want is independence.

582
27:34.880 --> 27:37.110
So as long as you act in this movie,

583
27:37.110 --> 27:39.440
I promise to use all my resources

584
27:39.440 --> 27:40.680
to make you a star.

585
27:40.790 --> 27:41.880
What is a star?

586
27:42.350 --> 27:43.790
It's the prestige where even

587
27:43.790 --> 27:46.200
the mayor would be eager to shake your hand.

588
27:46.350 --> 27:49.310
It's the respect your banker father can't buy,

589
27:49.330 --> 27:51.060
no matter how much money he has!

590
28:00.920 --> 28:02.380
You really have a good eye.

591
28:02.410 --> 28:04.000
This came in today.

592
28:04.410 --> 28:07.000
It's rare to find skilled artisans who can stitch a piece like this these days.

593
28:07.000 --> 28:08.680
All the clothes in the shop today

594
28:08.680 --> 28:09.960
are one of a kind.

595
28:13.550 --> 28:14.350
Mr. Tang,

596
28:14.830 --> 28:16.440
which one will look good on me?

597
28:16.440 --> 28:18.170
You'll look good in all of them.

598
28:18.240 --> 28:18.680
Really?

599
28:18.680 --> 28:19.270
Really.

600
28:20.920 --> 28:21.720
Alright then.

601
28:22.400 --> 28:23.130
Wrap them up.

602
28:23.310 --> 28:24.270
Which one?

603
28:24.440 --> 28:25.310
All.

604
28:28.830 --> 28:29.560
Is that okay,

605
28:29.750 --> 28:30.720
Mr. Tang?

606
28:31.920 --> 28:33.200
Sure.

607
28:33.960 --> 28:35.490
Okay! Please wait a moment.

608
28:37.760 --> 28:39.490
I think you're right, Mr. Tang.

609
28:39.700 --> 28:41.670
Only these unique clothes

610
28:42.070 --> 28:43.240
can match

611
28:43.510 --> 28:45.110
the prestige you'll give me.

612
28:46.030 --> 28:47.680
Please make the receipt out

613
28:47.680 --> 28:48.790
to the production crew.

614
28:48.790 --> 28:49.480
Thank you.

615
28:50.440 --> 28:51.100
Miss Jiang,

616
28:51.610 --> 28:53.670
the plan is progressing seamlessly.

617
28:53.860 --> 28:55.490
Now we have the money,

618
28:56.070 --> 28:58.020
but we're far from done.

619
28:59.440 --> 29:00.480
You're not really going to

620
29:00.480 --> 29:02.680
finish shooting Tang's movie, are you?

621
29:24.900 --> 29:25.530
Master,

622
29:26.350 --> 29:27.740
are we just going to watch him?

623
29:27.740 --> 29:28.940
What do you want to do?

624
29:29.400 --> 29:31.130
This setup belongs to Jiang Feiyan.

625
29:31.130 --> 29:32.530
She's made a lot of money.

626
29:32.920 --> 29:34.250
It's hard to interfere.

627
29:34.440 --> 29:35.720
This Wang Jiaxian

628
29:35.720 --> 29:37.750
is within arm's reach, though.

629
29:38.200 --> 29:39.440
That kid Shangguan

630
29:39.440 --> 29:40.970
only dealt with one Cao San.

631
29:41.550 --> 29:43.160
He's still a little chick.

632
29:44.160 --> 29:45.690
Just wait for him to slip up.

633
29:45.960 --> 29:46.830
Understood.

634
29:50.640 --> 29:52.030
What does this fate mean?

635
29:52.030 --> 29:54.110
It means you have a benefactor in your life.

636
29:54.110 --> 29:54.480
Really?

637
29:54.480 --> 29:55.240
And they are

638
29:56.000 --> 29:57.930
a benefactor who helps you in life.

639
29:59.550 --> 30:01.750
The drinks are here. Let's have a toast.

640
30:08.590 --> 30:09.550
Your husband?

641
30:09.960 --> 30:10.790
No.

642
30:13.120 --> 30:14.380
What's wrong with you?

643
30:14.400 --> 30:15.830
You're asking for it, huh?

644
30:15.830 --> 30:16.920
Please calm down.

645
30:17.880 --> 30:19.480
Don't go. I'll take you home.

646
30:20.150 --> 30:22.350
I think you should check this out first.

647
30:29.470 --> 30:30.320
So,

648
30:30.350 --> 30:31.930
the press conference where you almost died

649
30:31.930 --> 30:33.240
was orchestrated by you.

650
30:33.240 --> 30:35.300
Do you take us journalists for fools?

651
30:35.500 --> 30:37.630
Faking a haunting to scare people

652
30:37.720 --> 30:40.250
and deceive investors and the audience, huh?

653
30:41.750 --> 30:44.080
Hey, if this gets out,

654
30:44.480 --> 30:45.740
would it be considered

655
30:47.070 --> 30:48.000
huge news?

656
30:50.270 --> 30:50.830
Sit.

657
30:50.960 --> 30:51.640
Sit?

658
30:52.240 --> 30:52.920
Sit.

659
30:54.310 --> 30:55.110
Waiter,

660
30:55.610 --> 30:57.400
a bottle of your best wine.

661
30:57.580 --> 30:59.660
Put it on Mr. Tang's tab.

662
31:02.200 --> 31:03.270
I think

663
31:03.550 --> 31:05.630
your revised script is brilliant.

664
31:05.810 --> 31:07.960
Especially the scene you added for me,

665
31:08.080 --> 31:09.360
I really like it.

666
31:10.070 --> 31:11.070
Director,

667
31:11.210 --> 31:12.400
what's your opinion?

668
31:12.400 --> 31:14.440
I think the foundation is pretty much there.

669
31:14.440 --> 31:15.790
Next, we need to dig deeper

670
31:15.790 --> 31:17.350
into Ms. He's real life

671
31:17.350 --> 31:19.200
and real experiences.

672
31:19.350 --> 31:21.350
Great that we're on the same page.

673
31:21.440 --> 31:23.550
I was just worrying about

674
31:23.550 --> 31:25.310
how to dig deeper.

675
31:25.350 --> 31:26.310
Ms. He,

676
31:26.720 --> 31:28.650
I have a bunch of questions for you.

677
31:28.830 --> 31:29.400
First of all...

678
31:29.400 --> 31:30.640
Wait a second.

679
31:34.120 --> 31:36.030
Can I share my opinion?

680
31:38.580 --> 31:39.900
I took a look

681
31:39.920 --> 31:41.160
at this script.

682
31:41.190 --> 31:42.500
Personally, I think

683
31:43.350 --> 31:44.240
it's rubbish.

684
31:45.440 --> 31:47.030
What the hell did you write?

685
31:47.030 --> 31:48.920
So much pointless foreshadowing!

686
31:48.920 --> 31:50.240
Will anyone watch this?

687
31:50.240 --> 31:51.920
People want to see Ms. He's

688
31:51.940 --> 31:52.830
breasts and ass.

689
31:52.830 --> 31:54.830
Why write that she went to junior high?

690
31:54.830 --> 31:55.550
Rubbish.

691
31:56.110 --> 31:57.020
Absolute rubbish.

692
31:57.020 --> 31:58.370
These are all useless.

693
31:58.610 --> 32:00.000
Cut the first third.

694
32:00.510 --> 32:01.750
Just start with the sex scene.

695
32:01.750 --> 32:04.160
W-What movie starts with a sex scene?

696
32:04.640 --> 32:05.830
Do you want the whole country

697
32:05.830 --> 32:07.030
to see Ms. He as a joke?

698
32:07.160 --> 32:08.820
Isn't a movie all about jokes?

699
32:08.960 --> 32:10.420
Don't you guys like jokes?

700
32:10.960 --> 32:11.720
Manyu,

701
32:12.510 --> 32:14.110
you like jokes too, right?

702
32:16.350 --> 32:18.030
That depends on how

703
32:18.030 --> 32:19.070
the jokes are written.

704
32:19.070 --> 32:19.920
Anyway,

705
32:19.940 --> 32:21.660
I have no breasts and no ass.

706
32:21.830 --> 32:22.590
Even if I did,

707
32:22.720 --> 32:24.270
I wouldn't show them to you.

708
32:24.680 --> 32:26.000
Ridiculous.

709
32:27.070 --> 32:27.680
Alright.

710
32:28.110 --> 32:29.590
The joke is that

711
32:30.080 --> 32:32.160
in real life, my wife dies,

712
32:32.180 --> 32:33.100
so I'm sad,

713
32:33.160 --> 32:33.790
upset,

714
32:33.790 --> 32:34.680
and in agony.

715
32:34.680 --> 32:36.640
In the movie, it's still me,

716
32:36.640 --> 32:38.070
and my wife still dies,

717
32:38.070 --> 32:39.790
but I'm on cloud nine

718
32:39.790 --> 32:41.250
and painting the town red.

719
32:41.640 --> 32:42.750
This is called doing the opposite,

720
32:42.750 --> 32:44.160
which is what makes drama.

721
32:44.160 --> 32:44.830
Am I right?

722
32:44.880 --> 32:45.750
Mr. Tang, you are

723
32:45.750 --> 32:47.610
sacrificing a lot for this movie.

724
32:48.960 --> 32:50.680
Not putting money in your own pocket

725
32:50.680 --> 32:52.160
is the real sacrifice.

726
32:52.350 --> 32:53.350
Just write what

727
32:53.400 --> 32:55.510
appeals to the audience and sells tickets.

728
32:55.510 --> 32:57.400
He Manzhi's death

729
32:57.960 --> 32:59.440
must be glamorous,

730
32:59.790 --> 33:01.350
in bed,

731
33:01.350 --> 33:03.510
and at the hands of her lover.

732
33:04.310 --> 33:05.070
I object.

733
33:06.080 --> 33:07.190
I'm not acting in

734
33:07.440 --> 33:08.440
a movie like this.

735
33:09.230 --> 33:10.020
Mr. Screenwriter,

736
33:10.020 --> 33:11.670
I'll give you an example.

737
33:11.690 --> 33:13.800
Take the ghost-catching scenes

738
33:13.960 --> 33:16.440
in this draft of the script.

739
33:16.720 --> 33:19.510
Our beautiful Manyu plays the female ghost.

740
33:20.720 --> 33:22.180
If there's a female ghost,

741
33:22.640 --> 33:23.940
there must be a sorcerer.

742
33:23.940 --> 33:25.640
You need a sorcerer to catch a ghost.

743
33:25.640 --> 33:27.230
It's only logical, right?

744
33:28.110 --> 33:30.110
But has anyone envisioned

745
33:30.290 --> 33:31.550
that this sorcerer...

746
33:34.710 --> 33:36.140
is also a ghost?

747
33:37.750 --> 33:39.880
He's in cahoots with the female ghost.

748
33:45.230 --> 33:47.230
No one would see that coming, right?

749
33:50.350 --> 33:51.480
But I did.

750
33:52.360 --> 33:54.640
I think you all get the picture now.

751
33:56.270 --> 33:57.830
If you do, leave.

752
33:57.920 --> 33:58.640
Mr. Tang,

753
33:59.090 --> 34:00.570
what do you mean

754
34:00.600 --> 34:01.400
by leave?

755
34:01.420 --> 34:03.340
It means, get lost!

756
34:03.370 --> 34:04.410
Get the hell out!

757
34:08.790 --> 34:10.060
Manyu, you stay.

758
34:11.120 --> 34:12.409
I need to talk to you.

759
34:31.510 --> 34:33.510
You really are a top-notch actress.

760
34:35.550 --> 34:37.310
You scammed me out of so much money,

761
34:37.310 --> 34:38.909
and now you even want double.

762
34:41.280 --> 34:42.800
I've met my match.

763
34:43.150 --> 34:45.280
Even if the ghost possession was a lie,

764
34:45.550 --> 34:46.590
think about it:

765
34:46.630 --> 34:47.960
without me making this scene,

766
34:47.960 --> 34:49.889
how'd there be such citywide buzz?

767
34:50.000 --> 34:51.320
If the movie makes money,

768
34:51.320 --> 34:52.090
of course I want a cut.

769
34:52.090 --> 34:54.420
But you guys messed up, you know?

770
34:55.030 --> 34:56.030
See this?

771
34:56.110 --> 34:57.590
Someone took a picture of you.

772
34:57.590 --> 34:58.360
Crystal clear, huh?

773
34:58.360 --> 34:59.230
It's you, right?

774
34:59.230 --> 35:00.630
You know how much I paid this journalist

775
35:00.630 --> 35:02.030
to keep his mouth shut?

776
35:02.880 --> 35:03.880
Mr. Tang,

777
35:04.150 --> 35:05.510
investing and doing business

778
35:05.510 --> 35:07.030
are inherently risky.

779
35:07.050 --> 35:09.150
If you're such a chicken, why make a movie?

780
35:09.150 --> 35:10.400
Of course I'm making it!

781
35:10.400 --> 35:11.550
I mortgaged my car

782
35:11.550 --> 35:12.280
and my house,

783
35:12.280 --> 35:13.710
and even borrowed from loan sharks.

784
35:13.710 --> 35:15.360
Cancel the movie now when

785
35:15.360 --> 35:16.480
everything's on the line?

786
35:16.480 --> 35:17.510
Listen.

787
35:17.510 --> 35:19.230
This movie must be made.

788
35:19.400 --> 35:20.960
The cameras won't stop!

789
35:21.360 --> 35:22.230
Fine.

790
35:22.710 --> 35:24.190
Our cooperation stays.

791
35:24.280 --> 35:26.540
But I must get 10% of the box office gross,

792
35:26.630 --> 35:28.110
or I'm leaving right now.

793
35:30.660 --> 35:31.930
Is this a threat?

794
35:33.150 --> 35:34.360
This?

795
35:34.510 --> 35:36.030
Pretty much.

796
35:43.800 --> 35:45.320
Manzhi threatened me too.

797
35:45.760 --> 35:47.690
Do you know what happened to her...

798
35:48.760 --> 35:49.960
Don't make me laugh.

799
35:50.550 --> 35:52.150
I'm not like her.

800
35:52.630 --> 35:54.490
I've been a con artist for so long.

801
35:54.800 --> 35:56.680
I won't be as stupid as her.

802
35:57.280 --> 35:58.610
She committed suicide,

803
35:59.320 --> 36:00.510
but I won't.

804
36:02.070 --> 36:02.840
Manyu,

805
36:03.670 --> 36:04.840
do we really have to

806
36:05.000 --> 36:06.280
make it this ugly?

807
36:06.480 --> 36:08.280
That depends on your sincerity,

808
36:08.710 --> 36:09.670
Mr. Tang.

809
36:14.820 --> 36:16.220
That look in your eyes

810
36:16.840 --> 36:18.550
is so familiar.

811
36:18.660 --> 36:20.380
I'll let you in on a secret

812
36:21.030 --> 36:22.840
I haven't told anyone else.

813
36:23.630 --> 36:25.150
Have you ever considered

814
36:26.230 --> 36:28.360
that He Manzhi didn't commit suicide?

815
36:35.880 --> 36:37.240
I was just like this,

816
36:37.330 --> 36:39.080
strangling her neck.

817
36:39.190 --> 36:40.030
Let go.

818
36:40.030 --> 36:41.800
She also asked me to let go.

819
36:41.880 --> 36:43.110
Tang Yushan, what are you doing?

820
36:43.110 --> 36:43.590
Let go!

821
36:43.590 --> 36:44.630
The more she begged me,

822
36:44.630 --> 36:45.890
the tighter I gripped.

823
36:46.000 --> 36:46.980
The more she struggled,

824
36:46.980 --> 36:48.980
the harder I squeezed.

825
36:49.550 --> 36:51.320
Manzhi was also struggling the whole time.

826
36:51.320 --> 36:52.190
Help!

827
36:52.190 --> 36:54.000
I really want to know what exactly

828
36:54.000 --> 36:54.960
was going through

829
36:54.960 --> 36:57.020
Manzhi's mind right before she died.

830
36:57.400 --> 36:59.710
Was it fear or regret?

831
37:01.150 --> 37:01.950
Aren't you...

832
37:02.320 --> 37:02.920
afraid...

833
37:04.000 --> 37:05.000
of the police?

834
37:05.110 --> 37:05.920
The police?

835
37:07.000 --> 37:08.000
The police were here.

836
37:08.000 --> 37:09.260
Sorry for the trouble.

837
37:09.840 --> 37:11.000
But it's useless.

838
37:11.400 --> 37:13.800
Has this feeling been etched on your heart?

839
37:14.150 --> 37:15.950
This is exactly how Manzhi felt.

840
37:15.980 --> 37:16.840
Tang Yushan...

841
37:28.760 --> 37:30.290
Never forget this feeling.

842
37:30.880 --> 37:32.800
So you can learn your lesson.

843
37:42.030 --> 37:43.280
From now on,

844
37:43.710 --> 37:45.030
whatever it is,

845
37:45.360 --> 37:46.630
you do as I say.

846
37:46.960 --> 37:48.110
Keep acting

847
37:48.300 --> 37:49.680
being possessed by a ghost.

848
37:49.680 --> 37:52.080
But you won't get a single cent.

849
37:52.590 --> 37:53.710
Do you understand?

850
37:55.230 --> 37:56.750
At worst, you kill me.

851
37:57.230 --> 37:59.360
Let's see how you shoot the movie then.

852
38:00.280 --> 38:01.000
Kill you?

853
38:02.760 --> 38:03.230
Sure.

854
38:04.110 --> 38:04.800
No sweat.

855
38:05.150 --> 38:06.440
After you die,

856
38:06.880 --> 38:08.550
I'll find another girl.

857
38:08.920 --> 38:10.920
She'll take over and play the ghost,

858
38:11.400 --> 38:13.130
and the ghost will possess her.

859
38:13.590 --> 38:15.110
The headline will be

860
38:16.360 --> 38:17.710
"He Manzhi's Spirit

861
38:17.710 --> 38:19.590
Turns on Jiang Manyu:

862
38:19.590 --> 38:22.590
Another Ghostly Tragedy on Set."

863
38:23.230 --> 38:24.110
Do you like it?

864
38:24.840 --> 38:26.440
Will this headline go viral?

865
38:32.920 --> 38:33.650
Of course...

866
38:35.070 --> 38:37.190
You have another choice.

867
38:37.710 --> 38:39.480
Cooperate with me

868
38:39.880 --> 38:41.590
and finish this movie.

869
38:41.670 --> 38:43.470
As soon as the movie is released,

870
38:44.190 --> 38:45.190
you'll be famous.

871
38:46.000 --> 38:46.880
Then...

872
38:49.710 --> 38:51.100
we'll get married.

873
38:52.190 --> 38:53.510
With me, you'll have

874
38:53.880 --> 38:55.680
plenty of chances to make money.

875
38:55.880 --> 38:56.590
Live

876
38:57.280 --> 38:58.030
or die—

877
38:59.000 --> 38:59.880
make a bet.

878
39:13.590 --> 39:15.760
Your smile is really charming.

879
39:17.800 --> 39:18.800
Smile.

880
39:19.880 --> 39:22.510
Smile and I'll let you walk out of here alive.

881
39:26.160 --> 39:28.620
Your mother said you're good at everything,

882
39:28.710 --> 39:30.910
except for how expressionless you are.

883
39:31.070 --> 39:31.930
How about this?

884
39:32.470 --> 39:33.630
Give me a smile.

885
39:34.150 --> 39:36.880
If you smile, I'll let you stay in Tianxiang Sect.

886
39:49.400 --> 39:51.000
Your mother has passed away.

887
39:51.260 --> 39:53.420
This is the last thing she did for you.

888
39:54.110 --> 39:55.710
From now on, I'm your father,

889
39:56.360 --> 39:58.440
and Tianxiang Sect is your home.

890
40:02.550 --> 40:03.440
Manzhi.

891
40:04.000 --> 40:04.800
I promise that

892
40:04.800 --> 40:06.510
whatever you say goes from now on.

893
40:06.510 --> 40:08.310
You can take on any role you want.

894
40:09.440 --> 40:11.400
Did those rumors

895
40:11.400 --> 40:12.480
get to you?

896
40:12.590 --> 40:14.190
They're all lies.

897
40:14.190 --> 40:16.720
They were the ones who threw themselves at me.

898
40:17.760 --> 40:18.670
Forget it.

899
40:19.320 --> 40:21.030
See whoever you want to see.

900
40:21.070 --> 40:22.510
It's none of my business.

901
40:22.510 --> 40:23.840
I've booked my ticket anyway.

902
40:23.840 --> 40:25.000
I'm leaving tomorrow.

903
40:25.000 --> 40:26.000
Manzhi, if you...

904
40:26.030 --> 40:26.630
If you leave,

905
40:26.630 --> 40:28.630
this family will fall apart.

906
40:29.150 --> 40:29.670
Cut.

907
40:29.670 --> 40:30.840
That's about it for this scene.

908
40:30.840 --> 40:31.880
Let's run through the lines

909
40:31.880 --> 40:33.210
again for safety, okay?

910
40:33.510 --> 40:35.190
All departments, let's make final adjustments.

911
40:35.190 --> 40:36.920
We're going to shoot this take.

912
40:43.150 --> 40:43.800
Mr. Tang.

913
40:44.550 --> 40:45.190
Speak.

914
40:45.360 --> 40:47.150
We're almost out of film.

915
40:48.480 --> 40:49.360
Go buy some.

916
40:49.360 --> 40:51.280
The crew's accountant told me

917
40:51.670 --> 40:53.630
we're out of money.

918
40:57.920 --> 40:59.840
Manzhi, I love you.

919
41:00.480 --> 41:02.550
Everything they said is a lie.

920
41:02.550 --> 41:04.550
They were the ones who initiated it!

921
41:05.000 --> 41:05.760
Who are you playing?

922
41:05.760 --> 41:07.440
I'm playing you.

923
41:07.710 --> 41:09.000
Were you even trying to be like me?

924
41:09.000 --> 41:09.760
Take a break.

925
41:09.760 --> 41:10.480
Yang Xiaozhong!

926
41:10.480 --> 41:11.000
Yes!

927
41:11.400 --> 41:13.360
Clear the set.

928
41:13.360 --> 41:15.110
Leave only Manyu and me.

929
41:15.110 --> 41:17.510
I need to give her a quick lesson on

930
41:17.510 --> 41:19.670
the character's state of mind at that time.

931
41:19.670 --> 41:20.880
Okay, um, let's have

932
41:20.880 --> 41:21.710
a meal break, okay?

933
41:21.710 --> 41:22.960
Go eat, everyone.

934
41:23.070 --> 41:24.320
Thank you, Director.

935
41:24.510 --> 41:25.840
Come back after eating.

936
41:26.360 --> 41:29.070
I think it's very necessary for me to tell you

937
41:29.150 --> 41:30.440
the details of that time.

938
41:30.440 --> 41:31.630
The given circumstance

939
41:31.630 --> 41:33.030
is that she wasn't seated.

940
41:33.030 --> 41:33.920
At that time,

941
41:34.150 --> 41:34.960
she was here.

942
41:34.960 --> 41:35.960
Yes, right here.

943
41:36.590 --> 41:37.670
That day,

944
41:37.670 --> 41:38.920
we had a misunderstanding.

945
41:38.920 --> 41:40.920
I tried desperately to explain to her.

946
41:40.920 --> 41:42.100
I couldn't get through to her at al—

947
41:42.100 --> 41:42.790
Oh, right!

948
41:44.760 --> 41:47.020
She even locked the door from the inside,

949
41:47.070 --> 41:48.360
locking me out

950
41:48.510 --> 41:50.040
and insisting on a divorce.

951
41:54.590 --> 41:55.510
Honey.

952
41:56.440 --> 41:58.320
I was wrong.

953
41:58.630 --> 42:00.480
Open the door. Let's talk.

954
42:01.070 --> 42:02.280
Tang Yushan,

955
42:03.030 --> 42:04.320
I'm begging you.

956
42:04.320 --> 42:05.880
Can you just let me go?

957
42:05.880 --> 42:07.230
Open the door!

958
42:07.400 --> 42:09.760
Please, can you let me go?

959
42:09.760 --> 42:12.400
You're my wife, and you're begging me?

960
42:13.000 --> 42:14.070
Open the door!

961
42:14.070 --> 42:16.800
I treat you so well, yet you want to divorce me!

962
42:16.800 --> 42:19.000
Tang Yushan, you don't love me at all!

963
42:27.280 --> 42:29.680
We can finally have a proper conversation.

964
42:32.230 --> 42:33.480
In the script,

965
42:34.480 --> 42:36.210
it says I smashed the door open.

966
42:37.440 --> 42:38.880
But actually,

967
42:39.360 --> 42:40.510
I couldn't bear to do it.

968
42:40.510 --> 42:41.710
Our door is

969
42:41.840 --> 42:43.110
really too expensive.

970
42:43.310 --> 42:44.630
It was custom made.

971
42:45.840 --> 42:49.000
Guess who helped me open the door in the end?

972
42:49.880 --> 42:50.880
Director Fan,

973
42:51.190 --> 42:53.400
could I trouble your men to

974
42:53.400 --> 42:55.110
do me another small favor?

975
43:11.230 --> 43:12.030
Are you now

976
43:12.410 --> 43:13.810
clear on the characters'

977
43:14.280 --> 43:16.320
relationships and situations?

978
43:17.030 --> 43:19.070
You guys scammed a lot of money from me.

979
43:19.070 --> 43:21.710
Now I don't even have money to buy film.

980
43:21.960 --> 43:23.220
Where's that scammer?

981
43:23.880 --> 43:25.410
He has to spit the money out.

982
43:25.510 --> 43:26.970
He ran away a long time ago.

983
43:27.230 --> 43:28.110
I can't reach him either.

984
43:28.110 --> 43:29.110
You can't reach him,

985
43:29.110 --> 43:30.910
or you just don't want to tell me?

986
43:31.190 --> 43:32.430
Think again.

987
43:38.400 --> 43:39.000
Okay.

988
43:40.280 --> 43:41.230
Understood.

989
43:41.960 --> 43:43.230
How about this?

990
43:44.000 --> 43:46.060
I'll give you a few months to recover.

991
43:46.320 --> 43:47.520
During those months,

992
43:48.030 --> 43:49.280
think it over carefully.

993
43:49.280 --> 43:50.880
Maybe in a few months,

994
43:50.880 --> 43:52.540
there will be more media hype.

995
43:53.550 --> 43:54.760
It's settled then.

996
43:55.710 --> 43:56.440
Mr. Tang!

997
43:57.320 --> 43:58.150
Mr. Tang.

998
44:00.150 --> 44:01.200
Mr. Tang, you...

999
44:01.280 --> 44:02.420
I'm explaining the scene!

1000
44:02.420 --> 44:03.090
What is it?

1001
44:03.630 --> 44:04.710
Someone just came.

1002
44:04.710 --> 44:06.360
Another company in Yucheng is

1003
44:06.360 --> 44:07.780
releasing a movie next week

1004
44:07.780 --> 44:09.310
with the same gimmick as us—

1005
44:09.360 --> 44:10.670
also starring a ghost.

1006
44:10.800 --> 44:13.110
Their boss sent someone with a note,

1007
44:13.140 --> 44:14.600
inviting you to watch the movie.

1008
44:13.440 --> 44:15.440
[Tiansheng Pictures: 3F, Yongnian Building, Xiaoshizi Street]

1009
44:14.630 --> 44:16.280
They want to apologize to you in person

1010
44:16.280 --> 44:18.840
for stealing our thunder.

1011
44:30.670 --> 44:31.550
Mr. Tang,

1012
44:32.230 --> 44:33.800
I heard you were looking for me.

1013
44:33.800 --> 44:35.600
I'm just about to play the movie.

1014
44:35.960 --> 44:37.110
Want to sit down

1015
44:37.110 --> 44:38.590
and enjoy it together?

1016
44:44.110 --> 44:45.150
It's you.

1017
44:45.800 --> 44:47.440
I was just looking for you.

1018
44:55.360 --> 44:56.360
Where's my money?

1019
44:56.960 --> 44:57.880
I invited

1020
44:57.880 --> 44:59.440
more than just you today.

1021
44:59.630 --> 45:02.030
After all, everyone wants to see a movie with a ghost.

1022
45:02.030 --> 45:03.070
In a moment,

1023
45:03.070 --> 45:05.150
there will be many prominent figures.

1024
45:05.150 --> 45:08.070
Mr. Tang, it wouldn't be very decent of you to act like this.

1025
45:08.070 --> 45:08.960
Decent?

1026
45:10.670 --> 45:12.150
I didn't realize you were

1027
45:12.870 --> 45:14.540
also in the same industry.

1028
45:14.590 --> 45:16.050
You piece of showbiz scum!

1029
45:16.070 --> 45:18.400
You scammed my money and copied my idea, huh?

1030
45:18.400 --> 45:20.190
I didn't copy your idea.

1031
45:20.510 --> 45:22.150
The ghost was caught a long time ago.

1032
45:22.150 --> 45:23.000
Besides,

1033
45:23.360 --> 45:25.480
you're shooting a movie, which is all fake.

1034
45:25.480 --> 45:26.760
I'm shooting a documentary,

1035
45:26.760 --> 45:27.550
which is all real.

1036
45:27.550 --> 45:28.760
Cut your crap!

1037
45:29.550 --> 45:31.000
How can a fraud like you make movies

1038
45:31.000 --> 45:32.030
and catch ghosts?

1039
45:32.190 --> 45:34.030
Our Tiansheng Pictures has always

1040
45:34.030 --> 45:35.510
faced a lack of funds.

1041
45:35.510 --> 45:36.920
But thanks to your funding,

1042
45:36.920 --> 45:38.800
it's now a big production.

1043
45:38.800 --> 45:39.920
I've decided

1044
45:39.920 --> 45:42.070
I must give you credit for this movie.

1045
45:42.550 --> 45:43.680
Not only the credit,

1046
45:43.920 --> 45:45.150
but you must also

1047
45:45.590 --> 45:47.650
take the lion's share of the profits.

1048
45:49.360 --> 45:50.150
Check it out.

1049
45:51.360 --> 45:52.110
Fine.

1050
45:53.480 --> 45:54.680
If you're lying to me,

1051
45:55.510 --> 45:56.440
I'll kill you

1052
45:56.440 --> 45:58.170
and chop you up to feed the pigs.

1053
46:03.440 --> 46:05.190
I've been a con artist for so long.

1054
46:05.190 --> 46:06.670
I won't be as stupid as her.

1055
46:07.190 --> 46:08.590
She committed suicide,

1056
46:08.670 --> 46:09.800
but I won't.

1057
46:10.000 --> 46:11.320
Do we really have to

1058
46:11.320 --> 46:12.510
make it this ugly?

1059
46:13.230 --> 46:15.030
That depends on your sincerity,

1060
46:15.960 --> 46:17.150
Mr. Tang.

1061
46:19.550 --> 46:21.070
Have you ever considered

1062
46:21.920 --> 46:24.050
that He Manzhi didn't commit suicide?

1063
46:25.590 --> 46:27.110
I was just like this,

1064
46:27.320 --> 46:29.150
strangling her neck.

1065
46:29.550 --> 46:32.080
The more she begged me, the tighter I gripped.

1066
46:32.230 --> 46:34.830
The more she struggled, the harder I squeezed.

1067
46:34.840 --> 46:36.710
Manzhi was also struggling the whole time.

1068
46:36.710 --> 46:37.960
I really want to know what exactly

1069
46:37.960 --> 46:39.000
was going through

1070
46:39.000 --> 46:41.030
Manzhi's mind right before she died.

1071
46:41.030 --> 46:43.480
Aren't you afraid of the police?

1072
46:43.670 --> 46:44.510
The police?

1073
46:44.710 --> 46:45.920
The police were here,

1074
46:46.190 --> 46:47.280
but it's useless.

1075
46:47.280 --> 46:49.080
This is exactly how Manzhi felt.

1076
46:49.360 --> 46:50.840
You two are in cahoots,

1077
46:51.190 --> 46:52.450
trying to do me in, huh?

1078
46:52.670 --> 46:53.280
Stop!

1079
46:53.670 --> 46:55.070
Never forget this feeling.

1080
46:55.070 --> 46:56.000
Put that down!

1081
46:57.780 --> 46:59.450
Thank goodness you're here!

1082
47:00.030 --> 47:00.880
He's a scammer.

1083
47:00.880 --> 47:01.510
Arrest him.

1084
47:01.510 --> 47:02.170
Arrest him!

1085
47:02.480 --> 47:02.920
Cuff him!

1086
47:02.920 --> 47:03.980
What are you doing?

1087
47:04.020 --> 47:05.320
What are you doing?

1088
47:05.400 --> 47:06.440
Arrest him!

1089
47:06.590 --> 47:07.630
No!

1090
47:07.630 --> 47:08.690
What are you doing?

1091
47:09.440 --> 47:09.960
Let go!

1092
47:09.960 --> 47:11.230
Tang Yushan,

1093
47:11.380 --> 47:13.820
you committed murder.

1094
47:14.510 --> 47:16.510
The evidence is all here.

1095
47:17.610 --> 47:18.530
Come with us.

1096
47:19.000 --> 47:19.800
Take him away!

1097
47:20.000 --> 47:21.550
You got the wrong guy!

1098
47:21.550 --> 47:22.590
Arrest him!

1099
47:22.670 --> 47:23.480
Just you wait.

1100
47:23.480 --> 47:25.190
When I get out, I'll kill you.

1101
47:25.280 --> 47:26.190
Cut the crap!

1102
47:26.190 --> 47:27.320
You fraud!

1103
47:28.070 --> 47:29.110
You're not really going to

1104
47:29.110 --> 47:31.310
finish shooting Tang's movie, are you?

1105
47:31.320 --> 47:32.280
Look over there.

1106
47:32.880 --> 47:34.480
He's a gofer I borrowed

1107
47:34.710 --> 47:35.440
from Fourth Batou.

1108
47:35.440 --> 47:37.640
I think you should check this out first.

1109
47:39.150 --> 47:41.110
I installed a hidden compartment in Tang Yushan's

1110
47:41.110 --> 47:42.110
conference room.

1111
47:42.400 --> 47:43.530
When the time comes,

1112
47:43.880 --> 47:45.550
I'll intentionally give myself away,

1113
47:45.550 --> 47:46.810
and let Yang Xiaozhong

1114
47:47.150 --> 47:48.280
find a chance to film it.

1115
47:48.280 --> 47:50.610
But Tang Yushan's case is already closed.

1116
47:51.030 --> 47:53.090
How will you convince Wang Zhicheng?

1117
47:53.880 --> 47:55.280
Reopening the case

1118
47:55.670 --> 47:56.840
is too much trouble.

1119
47:57.000 --> 47:58.630
Do you know who

1120
47:59.480 --> 48:00.480
closed this case?

1121
48:01.190 --> 48:02.440
Fan Jialie.

1122
48:02.510 --> 48:04.190
I can provide you with evidence.

1123
48:04.190 --> 48:05.320
For a case like this,

1124
48:05.510 --> 48:06.970
first, you can gain merit,

1125
48:07.110 --> 48:08.150
and second,

1126
48:08.150 --> 48:10.080
you can interrogate him yourself.

1127
48:10.550 --> 48:12.190
Only then will we know

1128
48:12.510 --> 48:14.710
how much he actually gave Director Fan.

1129
48:16.070 --> 48:17.590
Then how can you be sure

1130
48:17.590 --> 48:19.230
that He Manzhi was murdered?

1131
48:21.070 --> 48:22.670
Because a person who is

1132
48:23.360 --> 48:24.960
killed first and then hung up

1133
48:25.920 --> 48:27.230
will have a stiff body.

1134
48:28.670 --> 48:29.840
So her feet

1135
48:30.460 --> 48:31.950
will also be flat.

1136
48:40.110 --> 48:42.590
This contains the footage Yang Xiaozhong took of you,

1137
48:42.590 --> 48:44.990
as well as unreleased footage of He Manzhi.

1138
48:46.070 --> 48:47.360
Are you really just going to burn it?

1139
48:47.360 --> 48:48.440
I'm a scammer.

1140
48:48.710 --> 48:50.070
The lesser people know

1141
48:50.070 --> 48:51.670
what I look like, the better.

1142
48:51.760 --> 48:52.760
Only by burning it

1143
48:52.760 --> 48:54.220
can Sect Master be at ease.

1144
48:54.440 --> 48:55.360
Hold it.

1145
48:57.000 --> 48:59.000
There's someone who still needs it.

1146
49:00.190 --> 49:01.070
I just saw you borrowing

1147
49:01.070 --> 49:03.200
a copy of "Midnight" from the library.

1148
49:03.400 --> 49:04.710
How is it?

1149
49:05.320 --> 49:06.720
The writing is too sharp.

1150
49:07.000 --> 49:09.590
But "Border Town," which you recommended, is good.

1151
49:09.590 --> 49:11.000
I read a few pages of the copy

1152
49:11.000 --> 49:11.880
my roommate borrowed

1153
49:11.880 --> 49:13.400
and really liked the phrasing.

1154
49:13.400 --> 49:14.530
What a coincidence.

1155
49:15.400 --> 49:17.670
I just re-read "Border Town."

1156
49:18.360 --> 49:19.560
Take it and finish it.

1157
49:19.630 --> 49:21.230
No rush. Return it whenever.

1158
49:21.670 --> 49:24.110
You also use leaves as bookmarks?

1159
49:24.920 --> 49:26.320
This leaf is thick enough.

1160
49:26.320 --> 49:27.920
It's perfect for a bookmark.

1161
49:28.230 --> 49:30.430
When I read this book, I was thinking how

1162
49:30.480 --> 49:32.400
the heroine Gong Cuicui is pure, gentle,

1163
49:30.510 --> 49:32.760
♪ Under the old city wall ♪

1164
49:32.510 --> 49:33.440
tender, and innocent.

1165
49:32.790 --> 49:35.900
♪ That year the rain fell gently ♪

1166
49:33.960 --> 49:36.020
It really matches this leaf of yours.

1167
49:36.070 --> 49:38.110
No imported bookmark from a bookstore can compare to this leaf.

1168
49:37.660 --> 49:43.620
♪ You walked by with an umbrella, saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

1169
49:38.880 --> 49:41.210
Let's wait till mid-autumn to meet again.

1170
49:41.280 --> 49:43.280
A pot of hot tea by West Lake is

1171
49:43.400 --> 49:45.920
only complete with Manjuelong Village's osmanthus cake.

1172
49:44.300 --> 49:46.810
♪ Later, a blade lay hidden ♪

1173
49:47.150 --> 49:48.960
My part of the footage has also

1174
49:47.400 --> 49:50.610
♪ Within a smile ♪

1175
49:48.960 --> 49:50.290
been destroyed, right?

1176
49:51.860 --> 49:59.110
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark cut deep into my heart ♪

1177
49:54.360 --> 49:55.960
Do you really have to do this?

1178
49:56.150 --> 49:57.630
Cries or laughs,

1179
49:58.190 --> 50:00.360
they were all fake.

1180
49:59.520 --> 50:01.920
♪ You know full well ♪

1181
50:01.950 --> 50:05.140
♪ How weak I am ♪

1182
50:05.660 --> 50:13.660
♪ Yet you always turn around, shielding me from harsh words and cold daggers ♪

1183
50:11.320 --> 50:12.720
After I get my revenge...

1184
50:14.670 --> 50:16.670
will you leave with me?

1185
50:14.800 --> 50:18.260
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

1186
50:18.320 --> 50:21.220
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

1187
50:21.870 --> 50:25.380
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

1188
50:21.920 --> 50:22.920
I actually

1189
50:24.150 --> 50:25.670
could've left a long time ago.

1190
50:25.400 --> 50:27.970
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

1191
50:27.840 --> 50:29.070
Then why did you...

1192
50:28.770 --> 50:32.310
♪ May you find your way out of the haze that is us ♪

1193
50:30.630 --> 50:31.710
Promise me:

1194
50:31.960 --> 50:33.400
don't die too early.

1195
50:32.350 --> 50:35.040
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

1196
50:33.760 --> 50:36.190
I promise I'll tell you when the time comes.

1197
50:35.820 --> 50:39.210
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

1198
50:39.280 --> 50:44.190
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

1199
50:48.420 --> 50:50.620
[In the next episode]

1200
50:50.690 --> 50:53.020
I'd like to invite you to my place to help me

1201
50:53.230 --> 50:54.680
cut off unwanted romance.

1202
50:54.680 --> 50:56.150
They want to kill my niece.

1203
50:56.180 --> 50:57.540
They want to

1204
50:57.560 --> 50:59.080
trap her soul.

1205
51:02.880 --> 51:03.990
Li Ling.

1206
51:04.430 --> 51:05.550
Li Ling?

1207
51:07.200 --> 51:08.590
The Zhang family's current prosperity

1208
51:08.590 --> 51:10.680
is built entirely on trapping souls.

1209
51:10.710 --> 51:11.510
Second bow to the parents.

1210
51:11.510 --> 51:13.480
They hired an evil sorcerer to cast a spell.

1211
51:13.480 --> 51:15.540
Once my Li Ling marries into their family,

1212
51:15.540 --> 51:17.450
they'll stuff her alive into a large vat

1213
51:17.450 --> 51:19.700
filled with talisman water!

1214
51:19.950 --> 51:21.660
You must also bless our family

1215
51:22.170 --> 51:23.890
with wealth, glory,

1216
51:24.420 --> 51:25.910
longevity, and health.

1217
51:27.410 --> 51:28.490
Seal the soul!

1218
51:29.250 --> 51:31.110
They want to trap my niece's soul,

1219
51:31.470 --> 51:33.950
so she can never be reincarnated.
